1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,200
Welcome back. Today: where your files really live.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,800
On your laptop, a file lives in one place. You can see it, and you can lose it.

3
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:12,600
In the cloud, the same file lives on someone else's computer, copied for safety.

4
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:16,400
So the difference: one copy you control, or many copies you rent.

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,600
Quick check. Which one keeps the file only on your desk?

6
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:23,600
Right: your laptop.

7
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:27,600
Recap: local is one place, the cloud is many, and you choose the trade.
